e feed. Bill Gates & his transhumanism agenda MUST be STOPPED. Bovaer's 3-NOP stays in the ANIMALS & threatens HUMAN FERTILITY through meat & dairy consumption.", "display_url": "substack.com/@stopthoseshot…", "end": 207, "expanded_url": "https://substack.com/@stopthoseshots/note/c-366133858?r=1id9y4", "images": [{"height": 567, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114831462344314880/Kvd7Pwj7?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 680}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114831462344314880/Kvd7Pwj7?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 184, "status": 200, "title": "Stop The Shots (@stopthoseshots)", "unwound_url": "https://substack.com/@stopthoseshots/note/c-366133858?r=1id9y4", "url": "https://t.co/LWaUz52Cp4"}]}, "id": "2114831461522317465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "COWS SICK, COLLAPSING &amp;  EUTHANIZED after Denmark MANDATED farmers add Bovaer to cattle feed. Bill Gates &amp; his transhumanism agenda MUST be STOPPED. Threatens human fertility. https://t.co/LWaUz52Cp4", "url": "https://x.com/BeThisAwaken/status/2114831461522317465"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114830760964448256"]}, "author_id": "988725552461811712", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:25:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114830775879393349"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 171, "start": 164, "tag": "MMCIVF"}, {"end": 186, "start": 172, "tag": "FertilityCare"}, {"end": 191, "start": 187, "tag": "IVF"}, {"end": 210, "start": 192, "tag": "ParenthoodJourney"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lnW1sZsj9q", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/mmcivf/status/2114830775879393349/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114830760964448256", "start": 211, "url": "https://t.co/lnW1sZsj9q"}]}, "id": "2114830775879393349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your dream of parenthood deserves more than treatment. 💙 With compassionate care and personalised fertility solutions, every step forward is guided by your needs.\n\n#MMCIVF #FertilityCare #IVF #ParenthoodJourney https://t.co/lnW1sZsj9q", "url": "https://x.com/mmcivf/status/2114830775879393349"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2087629432584347649"]}, "author_id": "1861734988317679616", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:56:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114838480647749647"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "In 2024, the total fertility rate in children per woman worldwide was 2.19. Between 1960 and 2024, the figure dropped by 2.5, though the decline followed an uneven course rather than a steady trajectory.", "display_url": "statista.com/statistics/806…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://statista.com/statistics/806110/fertility-rate-in-the-arab-world/", "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "Total fertility rate in children per woman worldwide 2024 | Statista", "unwound_url": "https://www.statista.com/statistics/806110/fertility-rate-in-the-arab-world/", "url": "https://t.co/k4bqruk1M0"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/0mpwU4BLFq", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/makeLOVEfamily/status/2114838480647749647/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2087629432584347649", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/0mpwU4BLFq"}]}, "id": "2114838480647749647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We need to make love more — fewer and fewer children are being born every year.\n\nIn 2024, the global fertility rate was 2.19 children per woman. Between 1960 and 2024, that figure dropped by 2.5.\n\nChildren are the future.\nLet's have more children.\n\nLink:\nhttps://t.co/k4bqruk1M0 https://t.co/0mpwU4BLFq", "url": "https://x.com/makeLOVEfamily/status/2114838480647749647"}, {"author_id": "1809681631357386752", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:45:17.000Z", "edit_